(7656840, 1246988, 67145, '<td valign="top">my first thought was .. that at a different time there may have been picnicers and children playing in this lovely scene ... it looks like a late afternoon shot and i''m almost feeling that end of the day feel .. <br/>of course this could be early morning which changes that feeling entirely .. lol .. <br/>a lot of feels going on .. !! .. ;)</td>', 'my first thought was .. that at a different time there may have been picnicers and children playing in this lovely scene ... it looks like a late afternoon shot and i''m almost feeling that end of the day feel .. of course this could be early morning which changes that feeling entirely .. lol .. a lot of feels going on .. !! .. ;)', '2020-03-29 15:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
